OL,3,AIndia's opposition set to hold mega
OL,4,Arally seeking election chief's
OL,5,Aresignation
OL,6,
OL,7,FTens of thousands of people have begun
OL,8,Fgathering in Indian capital Delhi for a
OL,9,Fmajor opposition rally demanding the
OL,10,Fresignation of the country's chief
OL,11,Felection commissioner and reforms to
OL,12,Fthe electoral system.
OL,14,FThe rally, organised by the main
OL,15,Fopposition Congress party, was due to
OL,16,Fbegin at noon (06:30 GMT) at the
OL,17,FRamlila Maidan grounds, but has yet to
OL,18,Fget under way.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
