OL,3,AIndia's opposition set to hold mega
OL,4,Arally seeking election chief's
OL,5,Aresignation
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeveral leaders of the Congress-led
OL,8,FINDIA opposition alliance are expected
OL,9,Fto attend, while the Gen Z-led pressure
OL,10,Fgroup Cockroach Janta Party (CJP) has
OL,11,Falso pledged its support.
OL,13,FThis is the latest show of opposition
OL,14,Fanger over a voter-list revision
OL,15,Fexercise that has removed 130 million
OL,16,Fnames from draft electoral rolls in
OL,17,FIndia.
